!
! A week's total of one measure (minutes of activity or sleep, ml of
! water), in Trebago: an exact sum from the first day on, refused rather
! than wrapped when a partial sum passes 64 bits.
trebago week
  in  amount(n)
  out week
  week = sum(i, amount(i))
end
